	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search Discogs releases, artists, labels and masters from Alfred.

Type `dg` and a query to search the Discogs database as you type.

![Discogs search results in Alfred](images/about/main.png)

## Commands

* `dg &lt;query&gt;` - search releases, artists, labels and masters as you type.
* Enter on an artist, label or master - its releases.
* Enter on a release - its tracklist.
* Cmd+Enter - open the item's Discogs page.

## Setup

* Open Configure Workflow and paste a Discogs personal access token (discogs.com/settings/developers) into Discogs API Token.
</string>
